{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-3ffdcbfb23937ad63338","title":"韩暨奏迎邺四庙神主建洛阳庙匡礼废淫祀","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-3ffdcbfb23937ad63338","label":"正文","text":"韩暨奏迎邺四庙神主建洛阳庙匡礼废淫祀","evidence":["hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0021","role":"奏迎神主正祀礼","evidence":["hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009","related_events":[{"event":"mingdi-e-o016a","type":"related","evidence":["hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009","mingdi-e-o016a-q"]}],"order":4894},{"id":"mingdi-e-o016a","title":"洛阳庙成韩暨迎四帝神主","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o016a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"洛阳庙成韩暨迎四帝神主","evidence":["mingdi-e-o016a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0021","role":"奉迎","evidence":["mingdi-e-o016a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":229,"label":"十一月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y229","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o013","basis":"十一月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o016a-q","mingdi-q-o013","mingdi-q-b-603b9eca40bc72aa5ca9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o016a-q","source_order":[3,91,"O016a"],"related_events":[{"event":"hancui-e-3ffdcbfb23937ad63338","type":"related","evidence":["hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009","mingdi-e-o016a-q"]}],"order":767}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0021","name":"韩暨","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-c3a111bad5e593fe2009","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-221c02e3b99b050bd5d1","layer":"original","quote":"时新都洛阳，制度未备；而宗庙主祏﹝一﹞皆在邺都〖1〗。暨奏请迎邺四庙神主〖2〗，建立洛阳庙；四时蒸尝〖3〗，亲奉粢盛〖4〗。崇明正礼，废去淫祀〖5〗，多所匡正。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o016a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7813ae24084c75e21fe4","layer":"original","quote":"初，洛阳宗庙未成，神主在邺庙。十一月，庙始成。使太常韩暨持节迎高皇帝、太皇帝、武帝、文帝神主于邺〖26〗。十二月，己丑至〖27〗，奉安神主于庙〖28〗。﹝一﹞癸卯〖29〗，大月氏王波调遣使奉献〖30〗，以调为亲魏大月氏王。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
